    "text": "By Avery Hughes ,\n11 hours ago SOUTHEAST — A scorcher of a day is setting up across the Southeast this afternoon, with heat and humidity building through the day before scattered storms develop across portions of the region during the afternoon and evening hours. Not everyone will see a storm, but stronger storms will be possible as instability increases, with gusty winds and frequent lightning serving as the primary threats. Read full article",
